message:
This is ugly, write this as a generator function

 for a in annotations:
   if a[..] != c:
     continue
   bad = CLFromBlameURL(...)
   if bad:
     yield bad

This cast jungle is ugly.. it can be rewritten as

 InsertDeleteFlags nTempFlags( nFlags & ~InsertDeleteFlags( InsertDeleteFlags::NOTE | InsertDeleteFlags::ADDNOTES));

I'll do in an amended commit.

Call venc_if_release if ctx->h_enc != NULL. Remove MTK_STATE_CREATE completely.

if (ctx->h_enc) {
  ret = venc_if_release(ctx->h_enc);
  ctx->h_enc = 0;
  if (ret) {
    ...
  }
}
